---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Word And Mouth | Corporate Podcast Production" description="Launch a broadcast-quality corporate podcast in 14 days. 30 years journalism. 25 years broadcasting.">
  <div class="podcast-page">
    
    <!-- SECTION 1: HERO -->
    <header class="hero-block">
      <h1 class="hero-headline">Stop Marketing.<br>Start Broadcasting.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Launch a Broadcast-Quality Corporate Podcast in 14 Days.<br>
        Led by a 30-Year Veteran Journalist.
      </p>
      <a href="#consult" class="hero-cta">Book Your Editorial Consult →</a>
      <p class="hero-micro">No commitment. Just strategy.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- SECTION 2: AUTHORITY STRIP -->
    <section class="authority-strip">
      <div class="authority-item">
        <span class="authority-icon">🏆</span>
        <span class="authority-text">UK Ambassador, <a href="https://radiotoday.co.uk/2012/10/nominations-wanted-for-podcasting-award/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">European Podcast Award</a></span>
      </div>
      <div class="authority-item">
        <span class="authority-icon">🎙️</span>
        <span class="authority-text">Founder, <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20111126211328/http://www.thepodcastguy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Podcast Guy</a></span>
      </div>
      <div class="authority-item">
        <span class="authority-icon">⭐</span>
        <span class="authority-text">680+ Recommendations</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 3: PROBLEM -->
    <section class="problem-block">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <span class="section-label">THE PROBLEM</span>
        <h2>Your Expertise is Being Drowned Out by Algorithms.</h2>
        <p class="problem-text">
          You have a world-class product. You have a team of visionaries. But your market doesn't know the depth of your value because they don't have time to read your 40-page white papers.
        </p>
        <p class="problem-text">
          They are drowning in AI-generated content. They are skeptical of "sales pitch" webinars. They are disconnected from your brand's soul.
        </p>
        <p class="problem-result">
          The result? Long sales cycles. Disengaged employees. Talent that chooses your competitor.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 4: SOLUTION -->
    <section class="solution-block">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <span class="section-label">THE SOLUTION</span>
        <h2>The Antidote to Artificial Intelligence is Human Authenticity.</h2>
        <p class="solution-intro">
          In a synthetic world, the human voice is the ultimate premium asset. A podcast is not just "content." It is a <strong>Relationship Engine</strong>.
        </p>
        
        <div class="benefits-grid">
          <div class="benefit-card">
            <span class="benefit-stat">23%</span>
            <span class="benefit-label">Shorter Sales Cycles</span>
            <p class="benefit-desc">Parasocial trust builds before the first meeting.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="benefit-card">
            <span class="benefit-stat">38%</span>
            <span class="benefit-label">Revenue Increase</span>
            <p class="benefit-desc">Average for brands launching podcasts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="benefit-card">
            <span class="benefit-stat">€7.9B</span>
            <span class="benefit-label">Market by 2030</span>
            <p class="benefit-desc">DACH podcasting is exploding.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 5: PODCAST PYRAMID -->
    <section class="pyramid-block">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <span class="section-label">THE PODCAST PYRAMID</span>
        <h2>One Recording. Dozens of Assets.</h2>
        <p class="pyramid-intro">Start with a video podcast. Harvest an entire content ecosystem.</p>
        
        <div class="pyramid-visual">
          <div class="pyramid-tier pyramid-top">
            <span class="tier-icon">🎬</span>
            <span class="tier-name">Video Podcast</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pyramid-row">
            <div class="pyramid-tier">
              <span class="tier-icon">📱</span>
              <span class="tier-name">Short Clips</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pyramid-tier">
              <span class="tier-icon">🎧</span>
              <span class="tier-name">Audio Episodes</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pyramid-row">
            <div class="pyramid-tier">
              <span class="tier-icon">📝</span>
              <span class="tier-name">Blog Posts</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pyramid-tier">
              <span class="tier-icon">💼</span>
              <span class="tier-name">LinkedIn Posts</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pyramid-tier">
              <span class="tier-icon">🔊</span>
              <span class="tier-name">Audiograms</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pyramid-row">
            <div class="pyramid-tier">
              <span class="tier-icon">📧</span>
              <span class="tier-name">Sales Clips</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pyramid-tier">
              <span class="tier-icon">📊</span>
              <span class="tier-name">Show Notes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pyramid-tier">
              <span class="tier-icon">🔎</span>
              <span class="tier-name">SEO Content</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pyramid-tier">
              <span class="tier-icon">📰</span>
              <span class="tier-name">Newsletter</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 6: METHODOLOGY -->
    <section class="method-block">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <span class="section-label">THE METHODOLOGY</span>
        <h2>Don't Hire an Audio Engineer. Hire an Editor-in-Chief.</h2>
        <p class="method-intro">
          Most podcast agencies will sell you a microphone and "clean audio." They won't tell you that your script is boring. They won't coach your CEO on how to answer a tough question.
        </p>
        <p class="method-bold">I do.</p>
        <p class="method-intro">
          With 30 years of journalism experience, I don't just edit your files; I sharpen your message. I bring the rigor of the newsroom to your corporate communications.
        </p>
        
        <div class="timeline">
          <h3>The 14-Day Newsroom Sprint</h3>
          <div class="timeline-items">
            <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="timeline-day">Day 1</span>
              <span class="timeline-task">Strategy & Angle</span>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="timeline-day">Day 5</span>
              <span class="timeline-task">Scripting & Coaching</span>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="timeline-day">Day 10</span>
              <span class="timeline-task">Production & Edit</span>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item active">
              <span class="timeline-day">Day 14</span>
              <span class="timeline-task">You Are Live</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 7: LISTEN -->
    <section class="listen-block">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <span class="section-label">HEAR THE WORK</span>
        <h2>Current Productions</h2>
        <p class="listen-intro">A selection of shows I currently host, produce, or have launched.</p>
        
        <div class="podcast-embeds">
          <!-- All Mouth -->
          <div class="podcast-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <span class="host-tag">Host & Producer</span>
              <h4>All Mouth</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="podcast-desc">Business storytelling and strategic communication.</p>
            <iframe 
              allow="autoplay *; encrypted-media *; fullscreen *; clipboard-write" 
              frameborder="0" 
              height="175" 
              style="width:100%;max-width:660px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;" 
              sandbox="allow-forms allow-popups allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-storage-access-by-user-activation allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation" 
              src="https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/pl/podcast/all-mouth/id1800202420">
            </iframe>
          </div>

          <!-- AI Today -->
          <div class="podcast-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <span class="host-tag">Host & Producer</span>
              <h4>AI Today</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="podcast-desc">Daily insights on artificial intelligence for business.</p>
            <iframe 
              allow="autoplay *; encrypted-media *; fullscreen *; clipboard-write" 
              frameborder="0" 
              height="175" 
              style="width:100%;max-width:660px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;" 
              sandbox="allow-forms allow-popups allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-storage-access-by-user-activation allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation" 
              src="https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/ai-today/id1770010162">
            </iframe>
          </div>

          <!-- B2B Case Study Podcast -->
          <div class="podcast-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <span class="host-tag">Co-Host</span>
              <h4>B2B Case Study Podcast</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="podcast-desc">Radically reduce time to conversion with case studies.</p>
            <iframe 
              style="border-radius:12px" 
              src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/show/36tlWAeVvDPbIunuf95Ikm?utm_source=generator&theme=0" 
              width="100%" 
              height="152" 
              frameBorder="0" 
              allowfullscreen="" 
              allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" 
              loading="lazy">
            </iframe>
          </div>

          <!-- Agency Thinking -->
          <div class="podcast-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <span class="host-tag">Producer (Season 1)</span>
              <h4>Agency Thinking</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="podcast-desc">Conversations on the business of creative agencies.</p>
            <iframe 
              style="border-radius:12px" 
              src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/show/0aBdinsIR0JXTHmV9gv7Jg?utm_source=generator&theme=0" 
              width="100%" 
              height="152" 
              frameBorder="0" 
              allowfullscreen="" 
              allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" 
              loading="lazy">
            </iframe>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 8: TESTIMONIALS -->
    <section class="testimonials-block">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <span class="section-label">THE PROOF</span>
        <h2>What They Say</h2>
        
        <div class="testimonial-grid">
          <blockquote class="testimonial-card">
            <p>"If you have a content problem and no-one else can help... then you need to hire Dave Thackeray."</p>
            <cite>— Clare Newman, Business Manager, Michael Page</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="testimonial-card">
            <p>"What sets him apart from anyone I've ever met is the volume and practicality of his ideas. He's a machine!"</p>
            <cite>— John Scotland, Digital Content Producer</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="testimonial-card">
            <p>"Better than a can of red bull frankly! His style is supportive, creative, collaborative and exceptionally encouraging."</p>
            <cite>— Kath Roberts, Systems Coach</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="testimonial-card">
            <p>"He finds the essence of a brand and makes it simple to understand."</p>
            <cite>— Ben Gross, Director, Electric Circus Digital</cite>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 9: TIERS -->
    <section class="tiers-block">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <span class="section-label">THE OFFER</span>
        <h2>Choose Your Level</h2>
        
        <div class="tiers-grid">
          <div class="tier-card">
            <span class="tier-label">DIY</span>
            <h4>The Strategy Blueprint</h4>
            <p class="tier-desc">You drive, we map. A 3-hour strategy workshop, templates, and a pilot critique.</p>
            <a href="#consult" class="tier-cta">Get Started →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-card featured">
            <span class="tier-label">DIWY</span>
            <h4>The Executive Producer</h4>
            <p class="tier-desc">You record, we polish. Monthly editorial meetings, live direction, professional editing.</p>
            <span class="tier-badge">Most Popular</span>
            <a href="#consult" class="tier-cta">Get Started →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-card">
            <span class="tier-label">DFY</span>
            <h4>The Broadcast Newsroom</h4>
            <p class="tier-desc">White-glove service. I host, script, produce, and distribute. You just show up.</p>
            <a href="#consult" class="tier-cta">Get Started →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 10: FINAL CTA -->
    <section class="final-cta-block" id="consult">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h2>Your Audience is Waiting.<br>Let's Give Them Something Worth Listening To.</h2>
        <p class="cta-intro">
          The first step is a conversation with me. No sales pitch. Just an editorial critique of your current communication strategy.
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com?subject=Podcast Inquiry" class="final-cta-btn">Schedule Your Editorial Consult →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .podcast-page {
    background: #000;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  /* TYPOGRAPHY */
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .section-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* HERO */
  .hero-block {
    min-height: 90vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 10rem 2rem 6rem;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #111 0%, #000 70%);
    position: relative; /* Ensure this scrolls with the page */
    z-index: 1; /* Below the fixed header (z-index: 100) */
  }

  .hero-headline {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #aaa;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .hero-cta:hover {
    background: #fff;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .hero-micro {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #666;
  }

  /* AUTHORITY STRIP */
  .authority-strip {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .authority-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #888;
  }

  .authority-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .authority-text a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .authority-text a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* PROBLEM */
  .problem-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #050505;
  }

  .problem-block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .problem-text {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #aaa;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .problem-result {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }

  /* SOLUTION */
  .solution-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #000;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .solution-block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .solution-intro {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #aaa;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .benefits-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .benefit-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid #222;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .benefit-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-5px);
  }

  .benefit-stat {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .benefit-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .benefit-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #888;
  }

  /* PYRAMID */
  .pyramid-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .pyramid-block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pyramid-intro {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #aaa;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .pyramid-visual {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .pyramid-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .pyramid-tier {
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    min-width: 120px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .pyramid-tier:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .pyramid-top {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .tier-icon {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tier-name {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* METHOD */
  .method-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #000;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .method-block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .method-intro {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #aaa;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .method-bold {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .timeline {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .timeline h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .timeline-items {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 150px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid #333;
  }

  .timeline-item:first-child {
    border-left: none;
  }

  .timeline-item.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .timeline-day {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-task {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  /* LISTEN */
  .listen-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #050505;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .listen-block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .listen-intro {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #aaa;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .podcast-embeds {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .podcast-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid #222;
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .podcast-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.2);
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .host-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    align-self: flex-start;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }

  .podcast-card h4 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .podcast-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #aaa;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  /* TESTIMONIALS */
  .testimonials-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #000;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .testimonials-block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .testimonial-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .testimonial-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid #222;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .testimonial-card p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .testimonial-card cite {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #888;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  /* TIERS */
  .tiers-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

